322602,FEI-12-4592,mohammad,"Fabrication Enterprises Anatomical Model: Pelvic Skeleton, Female, with Movable Femur Heads","Fabrication Enterprises Anatomical Model: Pelvic Skeleton, Female",0,100,0,,"* This realistic pelvic skeleton model consists of hip bone, sacrum with coccyx and 2 lumbar vertebrae as well as movable symphysis.<br /> <EOL>* The anatomical detail of this high quality model is a great educational tool for a classroom or doctor's office.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,11.800,11.800,7.900,1000,Y,56195,Fabrication Enterprises/Models & Charts/Anatomical Models,,89.910,,Wednesday 23 July 2014 10:15:06 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,,70,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
322362,FEI-12-4504,mohammad,Fabrication Enterprises Anatomical Model: Phil the Physiological Skeleton on Hanging Roller Stand,Fabrication Enterprises Anatomical Model: Phil the Physiological,27,1222.500,0,,"* Phil is a full-size skeleton with joint system model.<br /> <EOL>* Demonstrate internal and external rotation of the limbs and show how the knee and elbow joints move and stretch.<br /> <EOL>* The flexible spine can make natural movements (lateral bend, movement and stretching, rotation). the hand bones of this skeleton model have been assembled on wire to show their natural position.<br /> <EOL>* The flexible assembly of the foot bones makes them maneuverable.<br /> <EOL>* The shoulder blades twist when the arms are raised.<br /> <EOL>* Even the low level of maneuverability of the sacroiliac joint and the sacrococcygeal symphysis can be demonstrated.<br /> <EOL>* Used in hospitals, schools, universities, and laboratories.<br /> <EOL>* The skeleton is ideal for active use in teaching and demonstrations.<br /> <EOL>* The skeleton is on a metal hanging roller stand (painted white).<br /> <EOL>* Measures at: 75.8"" and 21.1 lb.<br /> <EOL>* Features: 3-part skull, individually inserted teeth, removable arms and legs, natural cast, transparent dust cover and 3 year guarantee.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,36.300,19.700,9.100,1000,Y,56195,Fabrication Enterprises/Models & Charts/Anatomical Models,,1053.930,,Tuesday 22 July 2014 10:01:57 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,4053083000173,855.750,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
