316723,FEI-30-1983,ariel2,Fabrication Enterprises CanDo Balance Stone: 14" Diameter,Fabrication Enterprises CanDo Balance Stone: 14" Diameter,3,17.500,0,,"* The CanDo inflatable balance stone is a versatile addition to a therapy or play regime.<br /> <EOL>* Can be used to practice and reinforce coordination, proprioception, and balance.<br /> <EOL>* Stones can be filled with water or sand to weight them for added safety and stability.<br /> <EOL>* Stones can be used with the curved side down as a vestibular balance board.<br /> <EOL>* Top of stone is nubby side for tactile feedback and stimulation.<br /> <EOL>* Available in 7 inch and 14 inch diameter, individually or in bulk packs of 6.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,14,14,7,1000,Y,56152,Fabrication Enterprises/Exercise/Inflatable Core Training,,12.950,,Tuesday 08 July 2014 09:28:30 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,714905011138,9.600,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
