317493,FEI-00-1600,bhavesh,Fabrication Enterprises Intelect Shortwave Diathermy: SWD100,Fabrication Enterprises Intelect Shortwave Diathermy: SWD100,87,9110,0,,"* The Intelect SWD100 Short Wave Diathermy Unit is designed to offer unattended dry heat therapy to increase circulation and range of motion while decreasing pain and inflammation.<br /> <EOL>* Short Wave Diathermy produces high frequency, oscillating electromagnetic energy for easy tissue absorption and increased cellular metabolism for exceptional healing.<br /> <EOL>* The SWD 100 provides several intuitive, easy to use features to improve user interfacing and patient response.<br /> <EOL>* The Chattanooga Shortwave 100 offers a full color LCD touch-screen interface for quick and easy program selection.<br /> <EOL>* The Chattanooga SWD 100 offers multilingual software and over 90 clinical protocols on board as well as thermal dosimetry and quick-link indications for a wide variety of treatment setup options.<br /> <EOL>* The Intelect 100 also features 200 user defined protocol storage slots for improved personalization of patient treatment.<br /> <EOL>* The Intelect Short Wave Diathermy Unit is designed to accept a variety of both inductive and capacitive electrodes.<br /> <EOL>* Capacitive electrodes are characterized by using two applicator electrodes on both sides of the area of treatment.<br /> <EOL>* Capacitive applicators are indicated for use with superficial bodily areas such as knees and elbows.<br /> <EOL>* Inductive applicators are characterized by use of a single electrode drum and are positioned directly over the area of treatment.<br /> <EOL>* Inductive electrodes are indicated for use with deeper soft tissue injuries such as neck and back strains and sprains.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,40,40,40,1000,Y,56167,Fabrication Enterprises/Hot & Cold Therapy/Diathermy,,11219.690,,Friday 11 July 2014 04:35:51 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,048694016006,9110,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
318099,FEI-00-2738K,shahmuhammad,Fabrication Enterprises Intelect Transport: Stim / Ultrasound System with 5 Cm Head,Fabrication Enterprises Intelect Transport: Stim / Ultrasound System,7,3350,0,,"* Intelect Transport 2-channel stim and ultrasound combo unit features fully functional 1 and 3.3 MHz ultrasound frequencies.<br /> <EOL>* Two channels of electrical stimulation output.<br /> <EOL>* Ten user-defined memory positions for User Protocols.<br /> <EOL>* Four standard waveforms on board: Interferential, Premodulated, High Volt, and Russian.<br /> <EOL>* Pulsed and continuous therapy operation (10%, 20%, 50% and 100%).<br /> <EOL>* Independent intensity and parameter controls for each channel.<br /> <EOL>* Ergonomically designed Sound Head Applicators available in a variety of sizes (1 cm², 2 cm², 5 cm² and 10 cm²).<br />  <EOL>* All Sound Head Applicators are interchangeable with Electronic Signature&trade; residing on all transducers.<br /> <EOL>* Watertight sound heads for use in underwater therapy.<br /> <EOL>* Head-warming feature on all sound Head Applicators.<br /> <EOL>* Unit uniquely designed for tabletop, wall mount, therapy cart (sold separately) or mobile use.<br /> <EOL>* 110V or battery powered (battery pack sold separately) option.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56184,Fabrication Enterprises/Modalities/Clinical Electrotherapy,,2888.060,,Saturday 12 July 2014 07:14:03 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,,2345,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
