320684,FEI-12-1151,mohammad,Fabrication Enterprises PA BROM Basic: Back Range of Motion,Fabrication Enterprises PA BROM Basic: Back Range of Motion,4,395,0,,"* The BROM (Back Range of Motion Instrument) has set the standard for accurate, repeatable measurements of the lumbar and thoracic spine.<br /> <EOL>* The BROM uses a patented inclinometer based instrument for measuring rotation and lateral side bend in the preferred upright position.<br /> <EOL>* The magnetic inclinometer and reference eliminate hip substitution errors.<br /> <EOL>* The BROM is the only instrument that can measure lumbar rotation accurately.<br /> <EOL>* The BROM Basic includes two Universal Inclinometers for measuring flexion and extension of the lumbar spine.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,14,11,6,1000,Y,56138,Fabrication Enterprises/Evaluation/Range-of-Motion,,340.540,,Saturday 19 July 2014 11:00:48 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,714905028396,276.500,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
320679,FEI-12-1150,mohammad,Fabrication Enterprises PA BROM II Back Range of Motion Instrument,Fabrication Enterprises PA BROM II Back Range of Motion Instrument,6,495,0,,"* The BROM II (Back Range of Motion Instrument) includes the same inclinometer based instrument as the BROM Basic for measuring rotation and lateral range of motion of the lumbar and thoracic spine.<br /> <EOL>* The BROM is the only instrument that can measure lumbar rotation accurately.<br /> <EOL>* The BROM II features a unique, inclinometer based flexion/extension unit that allows multiple examiners to obtain accurate and repeatable measurements.<br /> <EOL>* The BROM uses a standardized written protocol.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,21,12,7,1000,Y,56138,Fabrication Enterprises/Evaluation/Range-of-Motion,,426.750,,Saturday 19 July 2014 10:49:34 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,714905028389,346.500,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
320686,FEI-12-1155,mohammad,Fabrication Enterprises PA CROM Basic: Cervical Range of Motion,Fabrication Enterprises PA CROM Basic: Cervical Range of Motion,2,395,0,,"* The CROM Basic (Cervical Range of Motion Instrument) has set the standard for accurate measurements of the sagittal, coronal and horizontal range of motion movements that can be performed by the cervical spine.<br /> <EOL>* Using a patented mainframe which is positioned to the nose bridge and the ears, the CROM eliminates location errors, initial head position errors and tracking errors.<br /> <EOL>* The CROM uses a patented rotation unit that allows the patient to be measured in the preferred upright position.<br /> <EOL>* The CROM replaces the dual inclinometer method for cervical range of motion measurements.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,9,9,8,1000,Y,56138,Fabrication Enterprises/Evaluation/Range-of-Motion,,340.540,,Saturday 19 July 2014 11:06:08 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,714905028402,276.500,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
320687,FEI-12-1156,mohammad,Fabrication Enterprises PA CROM Deluxe: Cervical Range of Motion,Fabrication Enterprises PA CROM Deluxe: Cervical Range of Motion,2,495,0,,"* The CROM Deluxe (Cervical Range of Motion Instrument) provides the same patented mainframe and rotation unit as the CROM Basic for measuring cervical flexion, extension, rotation and lateral side bend in the preferred upright position.<br /> <EOL>* The CROM Deluxe features the addition of a head forward unit for measuring protrusion, retraction and dorsal glide.<br /> <EOL>* Since the head forward arm is easily inserted into the mainframe, it takes only a few additional minutes to obtain head translation measurements without having to reposition the patient.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,18,9,9,1000,Y,56138,Fabrication Enterprises/Evaluation/Range-of-Motion,,426.750,,Saturday 19 July 2014 11:10:36 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,714905028419,346.500,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
320688,FEI-12-1157,mohammad,Fabrication Enterprises PA CROM III: Cervical Range of Motion,Fabrication Enterprises PA CROM III: Cervical Range of Motion,3,595,0,,"* The CROM 3 is the next generation of inclinometer based measurement instruments.<br /> <EOL>* Like the original CROM, it has a patented mainframe and rotation unit for range of motion measurements, but with the addition of three-inch ball inclinometers, it is easier to read and use.<br /> <EOL>* The ball technology reduces the inclinometer sensitivity to vertical positioning and the three-inch inclinometers read to one degree.<br /> <EOL>* The CROM 3 can be used for all cervical range of motion measurements.<br /> <EOL>* A specially adapted head forward unit for protrusion, retraction and dorsal glide can be purchased separately.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,9,9,8,1000,Y,56138,Fabrication Enterprises/Evaluation/Range-of-Motion,,512.960,,Saturday 19 July 2014 11:14:44 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,714905045812,416.500,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
320525,FEI-12-1066,mohammad,Fabrication Enterprises PA Deluxe Universal Inclinometer,Fabrication Enterprises PA Deluxe Universal Inclinometer,1,100,0,,"* The Deluxe Inclinometer utilizes a ball technology that reduces the inclinometer's sensitivity to vertical positioning.<br /> <EOL>* The Deluxe Inclinometer has a three inch dial that provides readings to one degree.<br /> <EOL>* The inclinometer is fluid damped to permit fast, accurate readings without waiting for oscillations to damp out.<br /> <EOL>* The Deluxe Inclinometer can be used to quickly and accurately measure upper and lower extremity range of motion measurements as well as lumbar, thoracic and cervical range of motion measurements.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,5,5,1,1000,Y,56138,Fabrication Enterprises/Evaluation/Range-of-Motion,,89.910,,Saturday 19 July 2014 03:32:01 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,714905045829,70,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
320689,FEI-12-1180,mohammad,Fabrication Enterprises PA PALM Palpation Meter,Fabrication Enterprises PA PALM Palpation Meter,3,225,0,,* The PALM combines the ease and proprioceptive advantages of palpation with the objectivity and reliability of caliper and inclinometer measurements.<br /> <EOL>* *The caliper determines the distance in centimeters between the two palpating fingers.<br /> <EOL>* *The inclinometer determines the inclination in degrees between the two palpating fingers.<br /> <EOL>* A unique slide rule calculator gives you the height discrepancy between the two landmarks palpated in both centimeters and inches,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,15,12,5,1000,Y,56138,Fabrication Enterprises/Evaluation/Range-of-Motion,,193.980,,Saturday 19 July 2014 11:28:51 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,714905028426,157.500,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
320598,FEI-12-1097,mohammad,Fabrication Enterprises PA Universal Inclinometer,Fabrication Enterprises PA Universal Inclinometer,1,70,0,,"* The Universal Inclinometer makes it practical for each examiner to have their own inclinometer to measure range of motion.<br /> <EOL>* It replaces estimating range of motion or using a goniometer for quick and easy upper and lower extremity range of motion measurements.<br /> <EOL>* The Universal Inclinometer can also be used in pairs (dual inclinometry) to measure the lumbar, thoracic and cervical spine.<br /> <EOL>* The Universal Inclinometer is fluid damped to permit fast, accurate readings without waiting for oscillations to damp out.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,8,7,5,1000,Y,56138,Fabrication Enterprises/Evaluation/Range-of-Motion,,63.450,,Saturday 19 July 2014 06:34:02 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,714905045836,49,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
323317,FEI-11-1110,danisha,Fabrication Enterprises Parabath Paraffin Bath: with 6 lb. Unscented Wax,Fabrication Enterprises Parabath Paraffin Bath: with 6 lb. Unscented W,15,212.500,0,,"* Parabath unit is lightweight with a portable stainless steel tank for clinic or home use.<br /> <EOL>* Paraffin therapy is used for the treatment of patients suffering from pain associated with arthritis, strains, sprains, joint stiffness.<br /> <EOL>* It can also be used to increase range of motion.<br /> <EOL>* The deep oversized tank (6""W x 6""H x 12"" L) allows easy immersion of hand and wrist, foot and ankle, or elbow.<br /> <EOL>* The stainless steel tank has insulated outer housing to retain heat.<br /> <EOL>* The operating temperature is 125° - 134° F.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,18,15,5,1000,Y,56172,Fabrication Enterprises/Hot & Cold Therapy/Paraffin Therapy,,183.210,,Thursday 24 July 2014 01:59:22 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,087453240504,148.750,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
