322632,FEI-11-0731-1,danisha,"Fabrication Enterprises Point Relief ColdSpot Lotion: Gel Hands-Free Applicator Tube, 4 oz.",Fabrication Enterprises Point Relief ColdSpot Lotion: Gel Hands-Free A,1,10.500,0,,"* Point Relief ColdSpot topical analgesics are available with gel, roll-on and spray applicators.<br /> <EOL>* The over-the-counter formulas offers fast-acting, soothing, temporary relief of minor aches and pains of muscles and joints associated with simple backache, arthritis, bruises, strains and sprains.<br /> <EOL>* Water-based formula minimizes grease and residue.<br /> <EOL>* ColdSpot includes all natural ingredients including menthol, MSM, ilex, and arnica.<br /> <EOL>* Has refreshing Peppermint scent.<br /> <EOL>* Point Relief ColdSpot has a high active menthol concentration compared to some other leading brands.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56173,Fabrication Enterprises/Hot & Cold Therapy/Topical Pain Relief,,7.140,,Wednesday 23 July 2014 11:30:20 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,714905031105,5.250,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
