323253,FEI-11-1027,danisha,Fabrication Enterprises Relief Pak Hot Button Reusable Instant Hot Compress: Neck (11" x 17"),Fabrication Enterprises Relief Pak Hot Button Reusable Instant Hot Com,1,17.500,0,,"* The re-usable Hot Button hot pack instantly becomes hot once the button inside the pack is activated.<br /> <EOL>* The pack remains hot for at least 30 minutes.<br /> <EOL>* Re-usable pack is “recharged” and made ready for a future activation by boiling it for approximately 10 minutes.<br /> <EOL>* The activation and recharging of a pad can be repeated at least 100 times.<br /> <EOL>* The Hot Button contents are not harmful; they are common non-toxic food additives.<br /> <EOL>* Activate pad by gently flexing disk within the pad back and forth until pad starts to crystalize; pad will heat to approximately 130°F (54°C). for cold pack refrigerate do not freeze.<br /> <EOL>* To return to liquid state wrap pad in cloth, place in boiling water for 5 to 12 minutes.",,999998,2,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,12,10,6,1000,Y,56170,Fabrication Enterprises/Hot & Cold Therapy/Hot Packs/Therapy,,11.800,,Thursday 24 July 2014 11:51:47 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,714905047021,8.750,0,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
