318267,FEI-00-2787K,shahmuhammad,Fabrication Enterprises Vectra Genisys 4 Channel Stim with EMG,Fabrication Enterprises Vectra Genisys 4 Channel Stim with EMG,0,3885,0,,"* Vectra Genisys is the first modular therapy system that consolidates up to six therapeutic modalities in one system (ultrasound, electrotherapy, ultrasound/ electrotherapy combination, laser, sEMG, and sEMG + stim), at a fraction of what these modalities would cost alone.<br /> <EOL>* Unique modular design lets you choose what fits best in your clinical setting now or easily add to later without the replacement of products.<br /> <EOL>* All ultrasound and laser applicators are interchangeable and feature Electronic Signature&trade; for automatic recognition by the unit.<br /> <EOL>* Simply plug them in and go.<br /> <EOL>* Additionally, ultrasound applicators have a head warming feature for patient comfort and are waterproof for underwater treatments.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56184,Fabrication Enterprises/Modalities/Clinical Electrotherapy,,4784.690,,Saturday 12 July 2014 01:56:55 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,,3885,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
316906,FEI-30-2004,ariel2,"Fabrication Enterprises Versa-Form Plus Vacuum: Moldable Positioning, 16x20 Inch",Fabrication Entreprises Versa-Form Plus Vacuum Moldable Positioning ,0,162.500,0,,"* Versa-Form Plus offers all the advantages of the basic white Versa Forms, but in a more durable package.<br /> <EOL>* The high-grade vinyl used in the Versa Form Plus allows it to retain its shape up to three times longer than the standard Versa Forms.<br /> <EOL>* For customized, semi-permanent positioning anywhere contoured support is needed.<br /> <EOL>* Pillows are filled with small styrene beads that mold to the body's shape when air is extracted.<br /> <EOL>* When the valve is released, Versa Form regains its flexibility and is ready to be shaped again.<br /> <EOL>* Forms a firm, uniform support for all parts of the body, reducing risk of pressure points.<br /> <EOL>* Use to accommodate structural deformities and help control posture.<br /> <EOL>* Shapes and reshapes in seconds.<br /> <EOL>* Submerge in water for support in bathtubs and whirlpools.<br /> <EOL>* Easy to clean and disinfect.<br /> <EOL>* Includes repair kit.<br /> <EOL>* Vacuum pump and covers sold separately.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56200,Fabrication Enterprises/Pediatric/Positioning,,152.640,,Wednesday 09 July 2014 06:32:12 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3007,,121.850,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
