315710,FEI-10-1328,bhavesh,"Thera-Band Prescription Tubing Pack: Heavy (Blue, Black)","Thera-Band Prescription Tubing Pack: Heavy (Blue, Black)",2,15,0,,"* Thera-Band tubing is made of natural rubber.<br /> <EOL>* Resistance levels, obtained by varying the thickness of the tubing, are color-coded in proprietary Thera-Band colors increasing in difficulty through seven levels from tan through silver.<br /> <EOL>* The color-coding system provides positive reinforcement and feedback for gauging results.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,8,5,1,1000,Y,56156,Fabrication Enterprises/Exercise/Rehab Kits,,15.170,,Friday 04 July 2014 09:40:45 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3010,,11.250,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
315709,FEI-10-1327,bhavesh,"Thera-Band Prescription Tubing Pack: Light (Yellow, Red, Green)","Thera-Band Prescription Tubing Pack: Light (Yellow, Red, Green)",1,15,0,,"* Thera-Band tubing is made of natural rubber.<br /> <EOL>* Resistance levels, obtained by varying the thickness of the tubing, are color-coded in proprietary Thera-Band colors increasing in difficulty through seven levels from tan through silver.<br /> <EOL>* The color-coding system provides positive reinforcement and feedback for gauging results.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,8,5,1,1000,Y,56156,Fabrication Enterprises/Exercise/Rehab Kits,,15.170,,Friday 04 July 2014 09:31:41 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3010,,11.250,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
315959,FEI-10-1570,bhavesh,Thera-Band Professional Platform Exercise Station,Thera-Band Professional Platform Exercise Station,21,565,0,,"* The Thera-Band Exercise Station combines strength, balance and flexibility exercises into one convenient system for fitness and therapy.<br /> <EOL>* It allows easy progression of exercises by increasing the challenge or resistance of the exercise.<br /> <EOL>* The system was designed to integrate the use of progressive elastic resistance for strength training with exercise balls, fitness steps and stability trainers.<br /> <EOL>* The center cavity fits all popular exercise ball sizes as well as Thera-Band Stability Trainers, Rocker Boards and Wobble Boards (available separately). <br /> <EOL>* Custom designed Thera-Band Resistance Tubing with clip-on connectors allow the user to easily change between exercises and resistance levels.<br /> <EOL>* Users can also choose from attachments supplied with the station, including a 36"" padded exercise bar, two handles, or two Assist&trade; straps.<br /> <EOL>* Six connection points allow tubing to be attached at a variety of locations.<br /> <EOL>* Each Exercise Station comes with a full-color poster with 24 exercises and safety instructions.<br /> <EOL>* The durable, high-impact polyethylene construction holds up to repeat use.<br /> <EOL>* With 10 rubber feet on the bottom, it resists slipping on hard surfaces.<br /> <EOL>* And at approximately 14 pounds, the base is light enough to carry and is stackable to conserve space.<br /> <EOL>* Application include: Progressive Strength Training, Progressive Balance Training, Upper & Lower Extremity Strengthening, Closed Chain Exercises, Core Strengthening, Stepping Exercises and Senior Fitness and Rehab.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,45,26,4,1000,Y,56157,Fabrication Enterprises/Exercise/Resistance Bands,,521.890,,Saturday 05 July 2014 11:21:31 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3010,,423.750,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
315961,FEI-10-1572,bhavesh,Thera-Band Professional Wall and Platform Exercise Stations,Thera-Band Professional Wall and Platform Exercise Stations,39,1555,0,,"* The Thera-Band Exercise Station combines strength, balance and flexibility exercises into one convenient system for fitness and therapy.<br /> <EOL>* It allows easy progression of exercises by increasing the challenge or resistance of the exercise.<br /> <EOL>* The system was designed to integrate the use of progressive elastic resistance for strength training with exercise balls, fitness steps and stability trainers.<br /> <EOL>* The center cavity fits all popular exercise ball sizes as well as Thera-Band Stability Trainers, Rocker Boards and Wobble Boards (available separately). <br /> <EOL>* Custom designed Thera-Band Resistance Tubing with clip-on connectors allow the user to easily change between exercises and resistance levels.<br /> <EOL>* Users can also choose from attachments supplied with the station, including a 36"" padded exercise bar, two handles, or two Assist&trade; straps.<br /> <EOL>* Six connection points allow tubing to be attached at a variety of locations.<br /> <EOL>* Each Exercise Station comes with a full-color poster with 24 exercises and safety instructions.<br /> <EOL>* The durable, high-impact polyethylene construction holds up to repeat use.<br /> <EOL>* With 10 rubber feet on the bottom, it resists slipping on hard surfaces.<br /> <EOL>* And at approximately 14 pounds, the base is light enough to carry and is stackable to conserve space.<br /> <EOL>* Application include: Progressive Strength Training, Progressive Balance Training, Upper & Lower Extremity Strengthening, Closed Chain Exercises, Core Strengthening, Stepping Exercises and Senior Fitness and Rehab.<br /> <EOL>* The Thera-Band Wall Station is the first compact, total body rehabilitation system designed for in-clinic strength training, and it features the familiar colors and resistance levels of Thera-Band clip-connect tubing.<br /> <EOL>* This comprehensive rehabilitation system for upper and lower extremities features a multidimensional design with three planes of movement to teach patients the same proven Thera-Band system of progression they will use at home.<br /> <EOL>* The system also provides a comprehensive accessory package including soft grip handles, extremity straps, and head strap.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,90,35,10,1000,Y,56157,Fabrication Enterprises/Exercise/Resistance Bands,,1436.340,,Saturday 05 July 2014 11:34:43 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3010,,1166.250,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
315960,FEI-10-1571,bhavesh,Thera-Band Professional Wall Exercise Station,Thera-Band Professional Wall Exercise Station,18,990,0,,"* The Thera-Band Wall Station is the first compact, total body rehabilitation system designed for in-clinic strength training, and it features the familiar colors and resistance levels of Thera-Band clip-connect tubing.<br /> <EOL>* This comprehensive rehabilitation system for upper and lower extremities features a multidimensional design with three planes of movement to teach patients the same proven Thera-Band system of progression they will use at home.<br /> <EOL>* The system also provides a comprehensive accessory package including soft grip handles, extremity straps, and head strap.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,45,9,6,1000,Y,56157,Fabrication Enterprises/Exercise/Resistance Bands,,914.460,,Saturday 05 July 2014 11:27:15 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3010,,742.500,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
