317828,FEI-30-2132,medalif,"Thera-Band Stability Trainer: Black, X-Soft","Thera-Band Stability Trainer: Black, X-Soft",2,52.500,0,,"* Thera-Band Stability trainer is used to improve balance, postural stability, proprioception, and coordination.<br /> <EOL>* The unsteady surface challenges the body to maintain postural stability and balance.<br /> <EOL>* The softer the pad, the more vestibular challenge is provided.<br /> <EOL>* Stability Trainer is available in green firm foam, blue soft foam, or black inflatable x-soft.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,10,8,4,1000,Y,56145,Fabrication Enterprises/Exercise/Balance Boards/Pads,,50.960,,Friday 11 July 2014 10:55:31 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3010,,39.350,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
