318999,FEI-30-3101,medalif,Tumble Forms Grasshopper,Tumble Forms Grasshopper,92,2395,0,,"* Universal Grasshopper System includes seventeen different shapes and forms aid therapists in positioning children and adults, without resorting to unsanitary pillows and foam.<br /> <EOL>* Incorporates adaptive positions like side-lying, prone, supine, long leg and log roll sitting into therapeutic programs.<br /> <EOL>* Padded coaster base makes it easy to move client while maintaining adaptive support.<br /> <EOL>* Attach Tumble Forms 2 log to Grasshopper base to transform it into an active therapeutic system for vestibular stimulation activities.<br /> <EOL>* Latex free.<br /> <EOL>* Universal Grasshopper System includes: Padded coaster base with locking casters.<br /> <EOL>* 56""L x 30""W tapering to 24""W (142 x 76-61cm).<br /> <EOL>* Trapezoid module, 5""H x 18""L (13x46cm).<br /> <EOL>* Rectangular module, 5-1/2""W x 11""L x 3""H (14x28x8cm).<br /> <EOL>* Large wedge, 24""W x 28""D x 8""H (61x71x20cm).<br /> <EOL>* Small wedge, 20""W x 22""D x 6""H (51x56x15cm).<br /> <EOL>* Accessory wedge.<br /> <EOL>* Quarter roll support (2).<br /> <EOL>* Side abductor modules (3).<br /> <EOL>* Log: 8""W x 48""L x 7""H (20x122x18cm).<br /> <EOL>* Wrap strap (2).<br /> <EOL>* Hip strap.<br /> <EOL>* Side-lyer strap.<br /> <EOL>* Accessory bag.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,58,33,15,1000,Y,56200,Fabrication Enterprises/Pediatric/Positioning,,2212.230,,Tuesday 15 July 2014 05:23:11 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3022,,1796.250,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
