319004,FEI-30-3111,medalif,Tumble Forms Sidelyer,Tumble Forms Sidelyer,28,695,0,,"* Tumble Forms 2 Universal Side Lyer minimizes the time therapist, teacher or aide needs to monitor the positioning of neurologically impaired children.<br /> <EOL>* Universal size accommodates preschool through adolescent children.<br /> <EOL>* The 42""L x 23""W base is angled upward so gravity helps position the child.<br /> <EOL>* Two soft, easy-to-use straps permit infinite adjustment.<br /> <EOL>* Seamless, soft upholstery is urine- proof and easy to clean.<br /> <EOL>* Two block modules (3"" x 5"" x 11"") can be used as a headrest or for leg abduction (not included).<br /> <EOL>* Universal Side Lyer is 14""D.<br /> <EOL>* Backrest is 9""H.<br /> <EOL>* Latex free.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,44,30,13,1000,Y,56200,Fabrication Enterprises/Pediatric/Positioning,,641.970,,Tuesday 15 July 2014 05:33:16 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3022,,521.250,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
319341,FEI-30-3252,ariel2,"Tumble Forms Slotted Wedge: Large, 26""X16""X13"" WxLxH","Tumble Forms Slotted Wedge: Large, 26""X16""X13"" WxLxH",8,337.500,0,,"* Tumble Forms 2 Slotted Wedges offer a variety of positioning options for children and adults.<br /> <EOL>* Used in conjunction with supine mat, or bed positioning, the wedges help alignment of the hip, preventing rotation and providing adduction of lower extremities.<br /> <EOL>* Promoting comfort and optimal positioning during treatment sessions.<br /> <EOL>* Leg troughs offer a natural comfortable support to lower extremities.<br /> <EOL>* Latex free.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,27,17,14,1000,Y,56200,Fabrication Enterprises/Pediatric/Positioning,,311.720,,Wednesday 16 July 2014 11:12:56 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3022,,253.100,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
