319222,FEI-30-3152,medalif,Tumble Forms Soft-Top Balance Board: 18 x 24 Inch,Tumble Forms Soft-Top Balance Board: 18 x 24 Inch,25,300,0,,* Board has a padded non-slip top with recessed sides to help prevent "pinched" fingers.<br /> <EOL>* Use board for vestibular activities involving orthopedically and neurologically involved children.<br /> <EOL>* 18x24" top / 6" height.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,24,18,8,1000,Y,56197,Fabrication Enterprises/Pediatric/Balance Shapes,,277.120,,Wednesday 16 July 2014 07:24:31 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3022,,225,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
318998,FEI-30-3062,medalif,Tumble Forms Square Seat with 8 Positioning Shapes,Tumble Forms Square Seat with 8 Positioning Shapes,20,897.500,0,,"* Tumble Forms 2 shape set is designed to support and position children with neurological impairments, this set is ideal for a variety of settings.<br /> <EOL>* The Positioning System includes 8 positioners: two long rectangles, two short rectangles, two triangles, one round disk and one ring (does not include the box seat). Latex free.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,56200,Fabrication Enterprises/Pediatric/Positioning,,828.990,,Tuesday 15 July 2014 05:20:45 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3022,,673.100,42,N,224,Fabrication Enterprises Inc.
